{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soda Splash is the first game created by our two-person team. As a new team, \u300eCliCli\u300f is an efficient game editing tool that has helped us significantly in our development. Join our discord, we welcome your feedback and suggestions to help us improve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**Game features**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an exhilarating multiplayer co-op survival PvP game! Unleash your strength, agility, and intelligence to crush your soda cans, and flood the enemy with theirs!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480760/extras/\u57fa\u7840\u6218\u6597.gif?t=1740130638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your favorite character and let destiny decide your skills! Strategically utilize life springs and the shop to gather resources, grow stronger, and stay on your toes to avoid being surrounded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480760/extras/\u9009\u89d2\u8272.gif?t=1740130638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up to wipe out the soda cans\u2014going solo will only leave you vulnerable! Stock up on gear, and with seamless teamwork, achieve an epic victory!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480760/extras/\u9009\u6280\u80fd\u548c\u6bd2\u836f.gif?t=1740130638\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480760?t=1740130638","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740130638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480760/b6887c6b78df805c1050696b34a23c9a35d71ae5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740130638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets